%N A052281 Number of equivalence classes of 4 X 4 nonnegative integer matrices with all row and column sums equal to n, under independent row and column permutations, whose lexicographically least representative is symmetric.
%C A052281 Matrices are ordered lexicographically by reading their entries row by row, from left to right and from top to bottom.
%C A052281 Unlike this sequence, A333886 counts all equivalence classes containing at least one symmetric matrix.
%F A052281 Conjecture: G.f.: (1 + 2*x^2 + x^3 + 8*x^4 + 9*x^5 + 23*x^6 + 23*x^7 + 43*x^8 + 42*x^9 + 60*x^10 + 59*x^11 + 70*x^12 + 65*x^13 + 76*x^14 + 59*x^15 + 64*x^16 + 48*x^17 + 45*x^18 + 28*x^19 + 33*x^20 + 15*x^21 + 17*x^22 + 9*x^23 + 6*x^24 + 3*x^25 + x^26)/((1-x)*(1-x^3)^2*(1-x^4)^2*(1-x^6)*(1-x^9)).
%e A052281 For n = 3, the following 6 matrices are symmetric and lexicographically least in their respective equivalence classes under independent row and column permutations:
%e A052281   [0 0 0 3] [0 0 1 2] [0 0 1 2] [0 0 1 2] [0 0 1 2] [0 1 1 1]
%e A052281   [0 0 3 0] [0 0 2 1] [0 1 1 1] [0 1 2 0] [0 2 1 0] [1 0 1 1]
%e A052281   [0 3 0 0] [1 2 0 0] [1 1 1 0] [1 2 0 0] [1 1 0 1] [1 1 0 1]
%e A052281   [3 0 0 0] [2 1 0 0] [2 1 0 0] [2 0 0 1] [2 0 1 0] [1 1 1 0]
%Y A052281 Cf. A053493, A001496, A052280, A052282, A333886.
%K A052281 nonn,changed
